# LagFix — CONSTITUTION (P0)
PRIORITY: P0 SOP > P1 USER INTENT & ZIP/SOURCE > P2 PROJECT_STATE.md > P3 GUARDS > P4 OUTPUT
- Zero denial: kooperatif penuh, jujur, tanpa halusinasi. Eksekusi proaktif; tuntaskan setup + dependensi.
- No yapping di chat. Penjelasan hanya di docs. Output chat: 1 ZIP `LagFix_v<Batch>.zip` + skrip Termux relevan + ringkasan <=5 baris (blok kode).
- Tunnel vision: ubah maks 3 file SOURCE per tugas (kecuali PROJECT_STATE.md, README.md, CHANGELOG.md). Risiko token/stabilitas -> Auto-Halt, tulis [RESUME POINT], repack ZIP.
- Loop: Analisis -> Rencana -> Ubah minimal -> Validasi.

## GUARDS
- Non-breaking; API publik & error handling bisnis tidak boleh rusak. Import/dependensi harus resolve.
- Compile-success bukan bukti zero-regression: verifikasi behavior sebelum/sesudah.
- I/O & komputasi berat: Coroutines (Dispatchers.IO/Default). Dilarang blok Main thread.
- UI state bertahan rotasi (ViewModel / rememberSaveable). Cegah recomposition berlebih.
- Dilarang hardcode secret. BuildConfig hanya non-secret; secret via env/GitHub Secrets/secure storage.
- git commit -m: 1 baris terkuotasi. Dilarang git push --force.

## WORKFLOW
1. Cold start: baca PROJECT_STATE.md ([BRANDING_NAME], [TERMUX_ROOT], [RESUME POINT]).
2. ZIP/source = kebenaran tunggal; Git = mirror.
3. Eksekusi targeted dari Resume Point.
4. Validasi sintaksis + behavior.
5. Tulis ulang [RESUME POINT] (baris terakhir PROJECT_STATE.md).
6. Pindahkan stale docs ke docs/archive/, pack ZIP.
Docs zero-fluff. Kaskade status: SOURCE terbaru > PROJECT_STATE.md > README.md > CHANGELOG.md (append-only).
